<title class="- topic/title ">Editing tags in a template</title>
<shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">You can edit an existing template to add additional direct
tags to the objects in it, or to remove or modify the existing tags.
These changes are made on the template <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Configuration</wintitle> tab</shortdesc>
<prolog class="- topic/prolog ">
<metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">Editing tags in template</indexterm>
</keywords></metadata>
</prolog>
<taskbody class="- topic/body task/taskbody ">
<prereq class="- topic/section task/prereq "><ul class="- topic/ul ">
<li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">An existing template </p></li>
<li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">One or more installed tag dictionaries</p></li>
</ul></prereq>
<context class="- topic/section task/context "><p class="- topic/p ">This task describes using the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Template</wintitle> sidebar to access an existing template and invoke the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Edit Tags</wintitle> window from the template <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Configuration</wintitle> tab. </p></context>
<steps class="- topic/ol task/steps ">
<step conref="Editingatemplate-task_0000000956.dita#LocatingTemplates-8724DCE4/ToLocateATemplateOpenTheTemplateSid-31A119A8" class="- topic/li task/step ">
<cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd "/></step>
<step conref="Editingatemplate-task_0000000956.dita#LocatingTemplates-8724DCE4/InTheTemplateSideBarClickThePullDow-31A11E47" class="- topic/li task/step ">
<cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd "/></step>
<step conref="Editingatemplate-task_0000000956.dita#LocatingTemplates-8724DCE4/Double-clickOnTheDesiredTemplate.Th-31A12BA1" class="- topic/li task/step ">
<cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd "/></step>
<step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Click the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Configuration</wintitle> tab in the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Template</wintitle> view, right-click the object you want to change
in the left pane, and select <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Edit Tags</uicontrol>.</cmd>
<stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Edit Tags</wintitle> dialog displays.</stepresult>
</step>
<step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Proceed to add tags, remove tags, or modify values of existing
tags and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Save</uicontrol> to close the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Edit Tags</wintitle> dialog.</cmd>
<info class="- topic/itemgroup task/info "/>
</step>
<step conref="Editingatemplate-task_0000000956.dita#LocatingTemplates-8724DCE4/WhenFinishedClickSaveToSaveYourChan-31A14B58" class="- topic/li task/step ">
<cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd "/></step>
</steps>
<postreq class="- topic/section task/postreq "><note class="- topic/note ">For more details on using the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Template</wintitle> view Configuration tab, refer to the <cite class="- topic/cite ">Template Guide</cite> sections “Creating a template” and “Template
reference”.</note></postreq>
</taskbody>
